 "brief_title": "An Efficacy & Safety Study of BMS-512148 in Combination With Metformin Extended Release Tablets",
 "official_title": "A Multicenter, Randomized, Double-Blind, Active Controlled, Parallel Group, Phase 3 Trial to Evaluate the Safety and Efficacy of Dapagliflozin in Combination With Metformin as Initial Therapy as Compared With Dapagliflozin Monotherapy and Metformin Monotherapy in Subjects With Type 2 Diabetes Who Have Inadequate Glycemic Control",
